flowchart TD
  P[Plan ranked tasks] --> I[Implementer subagent wave]
  I --> G[Local gates]
  G --> S[Simplify: reuse quality efficiency]
  S --> R[Code review fanout]
  R --> R1[Correctness reviewer]
  R --> R2[Maintainability reviewer]
  R --> R3[Test coverage reviewer]
  R --> R4[Adversarial reviewer]
  R1 --> J[Coordinator synthesis]
  R2 --> J
  R3 --> J
  R4 --> J
  J --> V{Pass?}
  V -- no --> F[Fix issues]
  F --> G
  V -- yes --> C[Commit or submit]
  C --> K{Checkpoint?}
  K -- yes --> Q[Refactor and extended tests]
  Q --> P
  K -- no --> P
